OL,3,GNEWSAPostbox topper maker to quit after
OL,4,Acharacter stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has created toppers for a
OL,7,Fpostbox in Mansfield since 2020 is
OL,8,F'retiring' after her latest topper was
OL,9,Fvandalised.
OL,11,FDebbie Williamson, 60, has been
OL,12,Fdecorating a postbox in Clipstone Road
OL,13,FWest, Forest Town, since the Covid-19
OL,14,Flockdowns to "brighten things up a
OL,15,Flittle bit".
OL,17,FHowever, a character from her latest
OL,18,FWallace and Gromit-themed topper,
OL,19,FFeathers McGraw, was stolen two weeks
OL,20,Fago. Despite a plea on social media, it
OL,21,Fhas not been returned.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
